            "comment": "Power in kW calculated from the voltage and current (the controller has no kW or power factor register). Single phase (43002 = 0): V(L1-L2) * (I1 + I2) / 2, no power factor. Three phase (43002 = 1): sqrt(3) * V(average L-L) * I(average) * power factor. The power factor is 0.9 unless power_factor is set in genmon.conf (e.g. power_factor = 0.85) The reg is required for a gauge, the value comes from the list.",
